  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hfu - Marine environment protection in Southeast Asian Seas (MEPSEAS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to reduce the risks and impacts of marine environmental issues related to maritime transport in ASEAN region and to support the SDGs. The objective of the project is to assist vulnerable developing States of the ASEAN region (Indonesia, Malaysia, VIetnam, Cambodia, Phill, Myanmar and Thailand) to complete their legal, policy and institutional reform processes.</narrative>
  </description>
